      "lines": [
        "化简下列各式：",
        "1) $a-6.8-(3.4+a)-1.2$；",
        "2) $7.2-m+(m-4.6)+2.3$；",
        "3) $-(3.5+y)+(y+x)+4.8$；",
        "4) $m-7.3-(2.6+m)-3.4$；",
        "5) $8.9-k+(k-6.9)+7.4$；",
        "6) $-(6.8+n)+(n+p)+10$."
